<title>SINGAPORE: Labroy in US$57 mln time charter deals.</title>
<headline>Labroy in US$57 mln time charter deals.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Labroy Marine Ltd said on Tuesday it is expected to enter into two time charter party agreements worth US$57 million, with Indonesian state-owned oil firm Pertamina.  </p>
<p>The company said under the agreements, Labroy will charter to Pertamina two tankers with capacities of 1,500 deadweight tonne and 17,500 deadweight tonne respectively for a period of 10 years plus an option for a further two years.</p>
<p>The smaller tanker will carry clean oil products and the larger one crude oil.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
